## 18 ext4 造 bio 的循环

[visual: code_explain lang=c title="ext4_mpage_readpages：断开、开新 bio、挂页（Linux 6.12）"]
		if (bio && (last_block_in_bio != first_block - 1 ||
			    !fscrypt_mergeable_bio(bio, inode, next_block))) {
		submit_and_realloc:
			submit_bio(bio);
			bio = NULL;
		}
		if (bio == NULL) {
			/*
			 * bio_alloc will _always_ be able to allocate a bio if
			 * __GFP_DIRECT_RECLAIM is set, see bio_alloc_bioset().
			 */
			bio = bio_alloc(bdev, bio_max_segs(nr_pages),
					REQ_OP_READ, GFP_KERNEL);
			fscrypt_set_bio_crypt_ctx(bio, inode, next_block,
						  GFP_KERNEL);
			ext4_set_bio_post_read_ctx(bio, inode, folio->index);
			bio->bi_iter.bi_sector = first_block << (blkbits - 9);
			bio->bi_end_io = mpage_end_io;
			if (rac)
				bio->bi_opf |= REQ_RAHEAD;
		}

		length = first_hole << blkbits;
		if (!bio_add_folio(bio, folio, length, 0))
			goto submit_and_realloc;
===HIGHLIGHT===
lines=1-6
这页的盘上块和上一页不相邻？
先把手里的 bio 发走
同一个 bio 里的页，盘上必须连续
文件碎片在这里变成多个 bio
===HIGHLIGHT===
lines=12-21
新开 bio，最多 256 段
起始扇区 = 盘上块 << 3
完成回调 mpage_end_io 现在就埋好
预读路径打上 REQ_RAHEAD
===HIGHLIGHT===
lines=23-25
把整个 folio 挂进 bio
装满了就发走，再开一个

[narration]
翻源码要找三样东西：何时断开、起点怎么算、钩子埋在哪。第一段问这一页和上一页在盘上挨不挨着，不挨着就先把旧 bio 发走。第二段新开 bio，起始扇区是盘上块左移三位，回调设成 mpage_end_io。第三段把 folio 挂进去，装满再换一个。

